    <span id="copy-diag-status" style="display:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#4ade80">✓ Copié</span>
  </div>
  <details><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:22px">4 · Diagnostic PROFILE (dump Twig brut)</summary>
